## ⚠️ Concentration-risk caveat (the real issue isn't affordability)
- **You'd go from ~30% to ~55–60% of your entire portfolio in one ticker.** GME is already your largest holding ($3,257 of $10,820). Doubling makes it a majority single-stock bet.
